# SPACERUN3008

Welcome to SPACERUN3008, a thrilling space adventure game powered by Telegram.

## How to Play

1. Start the game by typing `/play` in the bot.
2. Use the controls to navigate your ship and avoid obstacles.
3. Collect points and climb the leaderboard!

Enjoy the game and don't forget to share your high scores!

## GitHub Pages

This repository is hosted on GitHub Pages, and the game is integrated with Telegram.
